; Versions: 18.2.0..19.3.0
"When one of the result codes defined here is included in a response, it shall be inside an Experimental-Result AVP and the Result-Code AVP shall be absent."
    absent-if Experimental-Result/Experimental-Result-Code in DIAMETER_ERROR_USER_UNKNOWN,
        DIAMETER_ERROR_ABSENT_USER, DIAMETER_ERROR_USER_BUSY_FOR_MT_SMS,
        DIAMETER_ERROR_FACILITY_NOT_SUPPORTED, DIAMETER_ERROR_ILLEGAL_USER,
        DIAMETER_ERROR_ILLEGAL_EQUIPMENT, DIAMETER_ERROR_SM_DELIVERY_FAILURE,
        DIAMETER_ERROR_SERVICE_NOT_SUBSCRIBED, DIAMETER_ERROR_SERVICE_BARRED,
        DIAMETER_ERROR_MWD_LIST_FULL


